# Database dumps — these contain REAL customer names, phone numbers and
# order history. They are backups, they belong on your own machine and on
# whatever you back up to, never in a repository that gets cloned by Render,
# Vercel, or anyone you share the code with.
*.sql.gz
*.dump
/shop.sql
/tailors_db.sql
/backup*.sql
# The migrations in database/ are schema only — no customer data — so they
# stay tracked. Only dumps at the project root are ignored.
